#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

Sun Yat-sen's premature death and the nature of the KMT's struggle up to this point have left finer details of our party's ideology vague and up in the air, torn a great many ways by various factions. How shall we define our party program from here on out?

- @communist_policy: The United Front
- @constitution_policy: The Constitution Question
- @mass_party_policy: Class and the Mass Party
- @land_reform_policy: The Issue of Land Reform
- @dangguo_policy: Outside Parties
- @root: Now is not the time to discuss these details
